                    <a href="/account/register" class="contribute-cta">Start writing →</a>
                </div>
            </section>

            @* ── Rewards & Governance ── *@
            <section id="rewards" class="wiki-section">
                <h2 class="wiki-section-title">Contributor Rewards &amp; Governance</h2>
                <p>ICPress is structured as a for-profit media company with a contributor equity component. Active contributors are eligible to receive equity in the platform through the Stakeholder Token (SSTK) programme, defined in the company charter and governing agreements.</p>
                <div class="rewards-card">
                    <h3>Stakeholder Tokens (SSTK)</h3>
                    <p>A significant portion of the company's equity structure is reserved for community contributors. SSTKs are distributed based on contributor activity and impact — not purchased. Contributors who build the platform's content library hold a real stake in its long-term value.</p>
                    <div class="rewards-detail-grid">
                        <div class="rewards-detail">
                            <div class="rewards-detail-title">Who is eligible</div>
                            <p>Active contributors whose articles have been published on the platform. Specific thresholds and eligibility criteria are shared during onboarding.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rewards-detail">
                            <div class="rewards-detail-title">How distribution works</div>
                            <p>Tokens are distributed based on reach and impact of published work. Mechanisms evolve over time; the foundational structure is defined in the company charter.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rewards-detail">
                            <div class="rewards-detail-title">Investor participation</div>
                            <p>The platform accepts outside investment under a conventional corporate structure alongside the contributor equity programme.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rewards-detail">
                            <div class="rewards-detail-title">Governance</div>
                            <p>Governance, distribution, and future equity participation mechanisms are detailed in the governing agreements and shared with contributors at onboarding.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top:16px;font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);">The platform does not sell contributor data.</p>
            </section>

        </main>
    </div>
</section>

@section Scripts {
<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    var links    = document.querySelectorAll('.wiki-nav-link');
    var sections = document.querySelectorAll('.wiki-section');

    function updateActive() {
        var current = '';
        sections.forEach(function (s) {
            if (window.scrollY >= s.offsetTop - 100) current = s.id;
        });
        links.forEach(function (l) {
            l.classList.toggle('active', l.getAttribute('href') === '#' + current);
        });
    }

    window.addEventListener('scroll', updateActive, { passive: true });
    updateActive();

    links.forEach(function (l) {
        l.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            var target = document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href'));
            if (target) window.scrollTo({ top: target.offsetTop - 80, behavior: 'smooth' });
        });
    });
});
</script>
}
